# GET_VWIRE, answered with one virtual wire group.
#
# Transcribed byte for byte from tests/vectors/espi_dump.txt, lines 72-82.
#
# The capture's own decoder labels the count byte "Length (00)". It is the
# Virtual Wire Count and it is 0 based, so 00h means one group follows --
# section 4.2.2, p.57. Index 05h, data 88h.
CMD 05 1B
TAR
RSP 08 00 05 88 0F 01 9F
